# [RXT-READERS] The `oracle` forms ALL THREE legs accept, in a block: a
# bare engine, an engine with a version, a HYPHENATED engine (a real
# testee/oracle slug such as `pcre2-dfa`), and `oracle none <reason>`
# (a counted, printed skip). One `oracle` line per block.
pattern a+
oracle python
m "aaa" 0 3

pattern b+
oracle pcre2/10.46
m "bbb" 0 3

pattern c+
oracle pcre2-dfa
m "ccc" 0 3

pattern d+
oracle pcre2-dfa/10.46
m "ddd" 0 3

pattern e+
oracle none python re cannot express this
m "eee" 0 3
